get.description:
Retrieve a flight of the day by its flight number:
- a departure flight is considered 'of the day' if it has any of departure times (OBT, TOT) within the time period from the start of the day to the end of the day;
- an arrival flight is considered 'of the day' if it has any of arrival times (LDT, IBT) within the time period from the start of the day to the end of the day.

Retrieve a flight of the day by its flight number:
- a departure flight is considered 'of the day' if it has any of departure times (OBT, TOT) within the time period from the start of the day to the end of the day;
- an arrival flight is considered 'of the day' if it has any of arrival times (LDT, IBT) within the time period from the start of the day to the end of the day.

Retrieve flights of an airport in the time window:
- a departure flight is considered 'in the time window' if it has any of departure times (OBT, TOT) within the defined time period;
- an arrival flight is considered 'in the time window' if it has any of arrival times (LDT, IBT) within the defined time period.

linkedId.description:
Unique identifier of liked flight:
- next departure flight for arrival flight;
- previous arrival flight for departure flight
